\r\nCORE APP FEATURES DEFINED\r\nVoice alert (Hindi/English), Hazard\r\n(detection, Offline mode, SOS\r\nAPP UI (FIGMA) PROTOTYPED\r\n7 screens: Login, Scan Waste, SOS, My ID QR,\r\nRecycler Map, Home Page, AI Chat.\r\nLOCAL HAZARDOUS WASTE DATASET\r\nCollected dataset: 200+ images\r\nfrom Pitampura (syringes,\r\nblades, sanitary waste)\r\nVOICE ALERT API VALIDATED\r\nTested: Voice alert flow using\r\nBhashini API prototype on 5\r\nBhashini sample images\r\nS L I D E  5\r\nFuture Action Plan\r\nFinancials\r\nR & D ,  A I  &  T e c h  S t a c k :  4 0 %  \r\nF i e l d  E x e c u t i o n  &  W o r k e r\r\nO n b o a r d i n g :  3 0 %  \r\nH a r d w a r e  &  I o T  I n t e g r a t i o n :  1 5 %  \r\nC l o u d  I n f r a s t r u c t u r e  &  S e c u r i t y :  1 0 %  \r\nO p e r a t i o n s  &  A d m i n i s t r a t i v e :  5 %  \r\nTechnical\r\nSmart wearable bands for health & biometric\r\nSOS alerts.\r\nTrain AI computer vision models on\r\nhazardous waste image datasets. \r\nTiered reward points redeemable for safety\r\ngear, health insurance discounts, or grocery\r\nvouchers for accurate waste sorting. \r\nSWOT Analysis\r\n6\r\nS O\r\nW\r\nT\r\nStrengths\r\nDual focus on worker safety and waste\r\nmanagement. \r\nVoice-based alerts overcome low\r\nliteracy barriers. \r\nOffline functionality and QR digital\r\nidentity. \r\nWeaknesses\r\nDependent on smartphones and digital\r\nliteracy. \r\nRequires continuous AI training for\r\naccurate hazard detection. \r\nOpportunities\r\nDirect integration with municipal systems\r\nand recyclers. \r\nAlignment with circular economy and\r\nwelfare schemes. \r\nThreats\r\nResistance to change from informal\r\nmiddle-men. \r\nHigh risk of phone damage in harsh field\r\nconditions. \r\nS L I D E  6\r\nApp UI/UX 7\r\nS L I D E  7\r\n7\r\nCase Study: Rohini, Delhi\r\nWaste pickers collect and sort recyclables.\r\nUnsafe conditions threaten worker health.\r\nMany lack formal recognition and support.\r\nThe Local Context\r\nImproved Worker Safety: Reduced exposure\r\nto hazardous waste and better awareness of\r\nhealth risks.\r\nEnvironmental Impact: Better recycling,\r\nless waste sent to landfills, and a cleaner\r\nDelhi.\r\nSurakshaSetu’s Potential Impact\r\nWaste picker collecting and sorting recyclables in Rohini, Delhi.\r\nS L I D E  8\r\n"
